Tails of Adventure
==================

Tails of Adventure is an open-source animated web series built on
FLOSS principles. It manages its own lore, characters, and scripts
as source code - free to study, modify, and redistribute under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

Quick Start
-----------

* Watch the series: https://www.youtube.com/@acstudiofficial
* Report a lore issue: Open an Issue on GitLab/GitHub
* Contribute: See Documentation/contributing.md
* License: See COPYING

Essential Documentation
-----------------------

All contributors should be familiar with:

* Series Bible: openbible/openbible.md
* Script Format: Documentation/formatting.md
* Code of Conduct: Documentation/code-of-conduct.md
* Contributing Guide: Documentation/contributing.md
* Credits: CREDITS


Who Are You?
============

Find your role below:

* Casual Viewer - You just want to watch the series
* Lore Contributor - Fixing errors, suggesting world-building ideas
* Script Writer - Writing episodes or story arcs
* Artist - Character design and reference sheet work
* Fork Creator - Building your own derivative series


For Specific Users
==================


Casual Viewer
-------------

Welcome! Start here:

* Watch the series: https://www.youtube.com/@acstudiofficial
* What is this repository: openbible/openbible.md


Lore Contributor
----------------

Help us build the universe:

* Series Bible: openbible/openbible.md
* Canon policy: Documentation/contributing.md
* Script format: Documentation/formatting.md
* Open an issue: GitLab/GitHub Issues
* Code of Conduct: Documentation/code-of-conduct.md


Script Writer
-------------

Write episodes and story arcs:

* Script format standard: Documentation/formatting.md
* Series Bible: openbible/openbible.md
* Existing scripts: scripts/
* Submission: via Pull Request on GitLab/GitHub


Artist
------

Design characters and reference sheets:

* Tails: characters/tails/tails-ref-sheet.png
* Wey: characters/wey/wey-ref-sheet.png
* Anton: characters/anton/anton-ref-sheet.png
* Lenka: characters/lenka/lenka-ref-sheet.png
* Ashley: characters/ashley/ashley-ref-sheet.png


Fork Creator
------------

Build your own derivative series:

* License: COPYING
* Canon policy: Forks are non-canon unless merged by BDFL
* Commercial exceptions: Contact ACStudio directly
* Contributing guide: Documentation/contributing.md


